<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Files built into the LeafMD program itself. GTK automatically looks for
     icons under /io/github/jeremehancock/LeafMD/icons.
     The view icons, the formatting bar icons, the replace icon, the new document icon
     and the side panel's icons live here.
     Icons GTK asks for by name, like the window's buttons, are in data/icon-theme (see main.rs).
     styles/ holds the raw text's colours, found by GtkSourceView through main.rs. -->
